  "_original_lore": [
    "Ability: Gorilla Tactics  RIGHT CLICK",
    "Marks your location and teleport back there",
    "after 3s.",
    "",
    "On coming back, burn enemies within 3 blocks",
    "and set your  Health to HALF of what it was.",
    "",
    "The burn deals 10% of ALL damage you dealt",
    "within the 3s, spread over 6s.",
    "Mana Cost: 200",
    "Cooldown: 20s",
    "",
    "☠ Requires Blaze Slayer 5.",
    "EPIC"
  ],
